<div id="S2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">For the first sum in (<a href="#S2.E15" title="In Proof. ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>), we note that for <math id="S2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|j\|_{\infty}\leq c_{2}(d)\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|j\|_{\infty}\leq c_{2}(d)\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="S2.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|k-j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\|j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\sqrt{d}\|j\|_{\infty}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\sqrt{d}c_{2}(d)\sigma\geq\|k\|_{1}-c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|k-j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\|j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\sqrt{d}\|j\|_{\infty}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\sqrt{d}c_{2}(d)\sigma\geq\|k\|_{1}-c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sigma</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S2.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|k-j\|_{\infty}\geq\|k\|_{\infty}-\|j\|_{\infty}\geq c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n+1)\sigma-c_{2}(d)\sigma\geq c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|k-j\|_{\infty}\geq\|k\|_{\infty}-\|j\|_{\infty}\geq c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n+1)\sigma-c_{2}(d)\sigma\geq c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>, by the elementary bound <math id="S2.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|x\|_{\infty}\leq\|x\|_{1}\leq\sqrt{d}\|x\|_{\infty},x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|x\|_{\infty}\leq\|x\|_{1}\leq\sqrt{d}\|x\|_{\infty},x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore we can bound that sum as</span></p>
