<div id="S2.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">For the third sum in (<a href="#S2.E15" title="In Proof. ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>), we observe that <math id="S2.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|k-j\|_{\infty}\leq c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|k-j\|_{\infty}\leq c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sigma</annotation></semantics></math> implies <math id="S2.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\|k-j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sqrt{d}\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-\|k-j\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-c_{2}^{\prime}(d,n)\sqrt{d}\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>, and therefore</span></p>
