<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S2.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2^{d-1}\sum_{i\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}\left|u(i)-u(i-e_{d})\right|." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2^{d-1}\sum_{i\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}\left|u(i)-u(i-e_{d})\right|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S2.p13.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p13.7.1" class="ltx_text">Using the same argument for <math id="S2.p13.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in\{1,\ldots,d\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in\{1,\ldots,d\}</annotation></semantics></math>, instead of <math id="S2.p13.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=d</annotation></semantics></math> and summing over <math id="S2.p13.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> one gets</span></p>
<table id="S2.Ex52" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S2.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|f_{n}(x)-p(k)\right|=\left|\sum_{i\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}u(i)v(i)\right|\leq\frac{2^{d-1}}{d}\sum_{i\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}\sum_{j=1}^{d}\left|p(i)-p(i+e_{j})\right|\leq\frac{2^{d-1}}{d}\frac{c_{3}}{\sigma}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|f_{n}(x)-p(k)\right|=\left|\sum_{i\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}u(i)v(i)\right|\leq\frac{2^{d-1}}{d}\sum_{i\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}\sum_{j=1}^{d}\left|p(i)-p(i+e_{j})\right|\leq\frac{2^{d-1}}{d}\frac{c_{3}}{\sigma},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S2.p13.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p13.8.1" class="ltx_text">where, in the last inequality, we have used that <math id="S2.p13.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math> satisfies condition <a href="#S1.I1.i3" title="item 3 ‣ Definition 2. ‣ 1.2 Main results and paper outline ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> of Definition <a href="#Thmtheorem2" title="Definition 2. ‣ 1.2 Main results and paper outline ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S2.p14" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, for item <a href="#S2.I2.i3" title="item 3 ‣ Lemma 16. ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, we have by (<a href="#S2.E27" title="In Proof. ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></a>), since <math id="S2.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|h_{n}|\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|h_{n}|\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
