<p id="S2.p14.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p14.2.1" class="ltx_text">But, using hypothesis <a href="#S1.I1.i2" title="item 2 ‣ Definition 2. ‣ 1.2 Main results and paper outline ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, the assumption <math id="S2.p14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|k\|_{\infty}\geq c_{2}\sigma+n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|k\|_{\infty}\geq c_{2}\sigma+n</annotation></semantics></math> and the observations that <math id="S2.p14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|k-i\|_{\infty}\geq\|k\|_{\infty}-n\geq c_{2}\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|k-i\|_{\infty}\geq\|k\|_{\infty}-n\geq c_{2}\sigma</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S2.p14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|k-i\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-nd," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|k-i\|_{1}\geq\|k\|_{1}-nd,</annotation></semantics></math> we have</span></p>
