<p id="S2.p16.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p16.4.1" class="ltx_text">Observing that the first term in (<a href="#S2.E31" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">31</span></a>) dominates and using a similar calculation as the one leading to (<a href="#S2.E23" title="In Proof. ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a>), we obtain</span></p>
