<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S2.Ex61.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\sum_{k}{\sup_{x\in k+[0,1)^{d}}|g_{n}(k,x)|}\lesssim\det{\Bigl(\mathrm{Cov}{(S_{n})}\Bigr)}^{-\frac{1}{2d}}\simeq_{d,n}\frac{1}{\sigma}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><munder><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.1389em">≲</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi>Cov</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><msub><mo>≃</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>σ</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}{\sup_{x\in k+[0,1)^{d}}|g_{n}(k,x)|}\lesssim\det{\Bigl(\mathrm{Cov}{(S_{n})}\Bigr)}^{-\frac{1}{2d}}\simeq_{d,n}\frac{1}{\sigma}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S2.p16.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p16.8.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, by (<a href="#S2.E37" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">37</span></a>),</span></p>
