</table>
<p id="S2.p17.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p17.3.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, by (<a href="#S2.E28" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">28</span></a>) and the exponential bounds on the entropy tails (<a href="#S2.E37" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">37</span></a>), (<a href="#S2.E39" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 2 Proofs of main results ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">39</span></a>), we obtain</span></p>
