<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3 </span>Sum of maxima of isotropic log-concave functions</h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following lemma bounds the sum of the maxima of a log-concave density using our previous concentration result.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmtheorem25" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmtheorem25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 25</span></span><span id="Thmtheorem25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmtheorem25.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmtheorem25.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem25.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmtheorem25.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> be a centered, isotropic, log-concave density on <math id="Thmtheorem25.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> with covariance <math id="Thmtheorem25.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma^{2}\mathrm{I}_{\mathrm{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma^{2}\mathrm{I}_{\mathrm{d}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmtheorem25.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq i\leq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq i\leq 2</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmtheorem25.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq j\leq d-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq j\leq d-1</annotation></semantics></math>. Then, as <math id="Thmtheorem25.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma\to\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma\to\infty</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S3.E52" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j}}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k_{1},\dots,k_{j},l_{1},\dots,l_{d-j})={O_{d}}\Bigl(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-i}}\Bigr)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j}}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k_{1},\dots,k_{j},l_{1},\dots,l_{d-j})={O_{d}}\Bigl(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-i}}\Bigr).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(52)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Set <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\lambda=c_{d}f(0)^{-1/d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=c_{d}f(0)^{-1/d}</annotation></semantics></math>, with <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is given in Lemma <a href="#Thmtheorem24" title="Lemma 24 (Concentration Lemma). ‣ 3.2 A concentration lemma ‣ 3 Discrete isotropic log-concave random vectors ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>. Then <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="f(x)\leq f(0)2^{-\|x\|_{2}/\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo rspace="0em">−</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em">/</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)\leq f(0)2^{-\|x\|_{2}/\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math>, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|x\|_{2}\geq\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|x\|_{2}\geq\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>. Moreover, from the definition of <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{f}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{f}</annotation></semantics></math>, its bounds and the inequality <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(0)\geq e^{-d}\max(f)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(0)\geq e^{-d}\max(f)</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex90" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex90.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\frac{c_{d}\sigma}{L_{d}}\leq\lambda=c_{d}f(0)^{-1/d}\leq\frac{c_{d}e\sigma}{L_{f}}\leq c_{d}\sqrt{2\pi e^{3}}\sigma." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi>σ</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{c_{d}\sigma}{L_{d}}\leq\lambda=c_{d}f(0)^{-1/d}\leq\frac{c_{d}e\sigma}{L_{f}}\leq c_{d}\sqrt{2\pi e^{3}}\sigma.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Note that</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex91" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex91.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j}}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)=\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}\leq\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)+\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j}}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)=\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}\leq\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)+\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">The first sum is easily upper bounded by <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{O_{d}}(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-i}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{O_{d}}(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-i}})</annotation></semantics></math>. Indeed,</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex92" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex92.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}\leq\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq(\max f)(2\lambda)^{d+i-j}=\frac{L_{f}^{d}}{\sigma^{d}}(2\lambda)^{d+i-j}\leq\frac{L_{d}^{d}(2c_{d}\sqrt{2\pi e^{3}})^{d+i-j}}{\sigma^{j-i}}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-i}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>σ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}\leq\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq(\max f)(2\lambda)^{d+i-j}=\frac{L_{f}^{d}}{\sigma^{d}}(2\lambda)^{d+i-j}\leq\frac{L_{d}^{d}(2c_{d}\sqrt{2\pi e^{3}})^{d+i-j}}{\sigma^{j-i}}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-i}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">Using the tails estimates of Lemma <a href="#Thmtheorem24" title="Lemma 24 (Concentration Lemma). ‣ 3.2 A concentration lemma ‣ 3 Discrete isotropic log-concave random vectors ‣ On the monotonicity of discrete entropy for log-concave random vectors on ℤ^𝑑" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a> and the fact that for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j}</annotation></semantics></math>, one has <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|l\|_{2}\geq\|l\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|l\|_{2}\geq\|l\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|l\|_{2}\geq\frac{\|l\|_{1}}{\sqrt{d-j}}\geq\frac{\|l\|_{1}}{\sqrt{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><msqrt><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|l\|_{2}\geq\frac{\|l\|_{1}}{\sqrt{d-j}}\geq\frac{\|l\|_{1}}{\sqrt{d}}</annotation></semantics></math> the second sum can be expressed as follows</span></p>
<table id="S3.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.Ex93"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex93.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex93.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq f(0)\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}2^{-\frac{\|l\|_{1}}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq f(0)\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}2^{-\frac{\|l\|_{1}}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex94"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex94.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=f(0)\left(\sum_{|l_{1}|&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}2^{-\frac{|l_{1}|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}\right)\left(\sum_{|n|&gt;\lambda}2^{-\frac{|n|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}\right)^{d-j-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=f(0)\left(\sum_{|l_{1}|&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|^{i}2^{-\frac{|l_{1}|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}\right)\left(\sum_{|n|&gt;\lambda}2^{-\frac{|n|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}\right)^{d-j-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text">Putting <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m11" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="x=2^{-1/\lambda\sqrt{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>λ</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=2^{-1/\lambda\sqrt{d}}</annotation></semantics></math> and assuming that <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\sqrt{d}\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\sqrt{d}\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in[\frac{1}{2},1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in[\frac{1}{2},1)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{2}\leq\lambda\sqrt{d}(1-x)\leq\ln(2)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{2}\leq\lambda\sqrt{d}(1-x)\leq\ln(2)</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex95" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex95.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{|n|&gt;\lambda}2^{-\frac{|n|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}=2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}x^{n}\leq\frac{2}{1-x}\leq 4\lambda\sqrt{d}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{|n|&gt;\lambda}2^{-\frac{|n|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}=2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}x^{n}\leq\frac{2}{1-x}\leq 4\lambda\sqrt{d}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.6.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=0</annotation></semantics></math>, replacing <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> by its value, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma\geq\frac{L_{d}}{\sqrt{d}c_{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma\geq\frac{L_{d}}{\sqrt{d}c_{d}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math> and thus</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex96" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex96.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq f(0)\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j}=\left(4\sqrt{d}c_{d}\right)^{d-j}f(0)^{\frac{j}{d}}\leq\frac{(4\sqrt{d}c_{d})^{d-j}L_{d}^{j}}{\sigma^{j}}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mi>j</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup></mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq f(0)\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j}=\left(4\sqrt{d}c_{d}\right)^{d-j}f(0)^{\frac{j}{d}}\leq\frac{(4\sqrt{d}c_{d})^{d-j}L_{d}^{j}}{\sigma^{j}}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.7.1" class="ltx_text">And, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math>, it is not difficult to see that, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex97" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex97.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{|l_{1}|&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|2^{-\frac{|l_{1}|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}=2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}nx^{n}=2x\left(\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}x^{n}\right)^{\prime}\leq\frac{6}{(1-x)^{2}}\leq 24d\lambda^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{|l_{1}|&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|2^{-\frac{|l_{1}|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}=2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}nx^{n}=2x\left(\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}x^{n}\right)^{\prime}\leq\frac{6}{(1-x)^{2}}\leq 24d\lambda^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.8.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, again for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma\geq\frac{L_{d}}{\sqrt{d}c_{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma\geq\frac{L_{d}}{\sqrt{d}c_{d}}</annotation></semantics></math>, which ensures that <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, we deduce</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex98" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex98.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq f(0)\times 24d\lambda^{2}\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j-1}\leq 2f(0)\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j+1}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-1}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}|l_{1}|\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq f(0)\times 24d\lambda^{2}\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j-1}\leq 2f(0)\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j+1}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-1}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.9.1" class="ltx_text">In the same way, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=2</annotation></semantics></math>, we easily get that, for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex99" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex99.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{|l_{1}|&gt;\lambda}l_{1}^{2}2^{-\frac{|l_{1}|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}=2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}n^{2}x^{n}=2x^{2}\left(\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}x^{n}\right)^{\prime\prime}+2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}nx^{n}\leq\frac{14}{(1-x)^{3}}+\frac{12}{(1-x)^{2}}\leq 26(2\lambda\sqrt{d})^{3}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msubsup><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>′′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>14</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>26</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{|l_{1}|&gt;\lambda}l_{1}^{2}2^{-\frac{|l_{1}|}{\lambda\sqrt{d}}}=2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}n^{2}x^{n}=2x^{2}\left(\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}x^{n}\right)^{\prime\prime}+2\sum_{n&gt;\lambda}nx^{n}\leq\frac{14}{(1-x)^{3}}+\frac{12}{(1-x)^{2}}\leq 26(2\lambda\sqrt{d})^{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.10.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, again for <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma\geq\frac{L_{d}}{\sqrt{d}c_{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma\geq\frac{L_{d}}{\sqrt{d}c_{d}}</annotation></semantics></math>, which ensures that <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\geq 1/\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, we deduce</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex100" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex100.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}l_{1}^{2}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq f(0)\times 26(2\lambda\sqrt{d})^{3}\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j-1}\leq 4f(0)\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j+2}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-2}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msubsup><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{l\in\mathbb{Z}^{d-j},\|l\|_{\infty}&gt;\lambda}l_{1}^{2}\max_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{j}}f(k,l)\leq f(0)\times 26(2\lambda\sqrt{d})^{3}\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j-1}\leq 4f(0)\left(4\lambda\sqrt{d}\right)^{d-j+2}={O_{d}}\left(\frac{1}{\sigma^{j-2}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
