<div id="Thmtheorem35" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_proposition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmtheorem35.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 35</span></span><span id="Thmtheorem35.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmtheorem35.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmtheorem35.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem35.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fix <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math> and let <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> be a log-concave p.m.f. on <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{Z}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{Z}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> with almost isotropic extension. Then, for every <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\leq i\leq d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\leq i\leq d</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex152" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex152.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}|p(k)-p(k-e_{i})|=O_{d}\left(\frac{1}{\det{\left(\mathrm{Cov}{(p)}\right)^{\frac{1}{2d}}}}\right)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo rspace="0em">det</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}}|p(k)-p(k-e_{i})|=O_{d}\left(\frac{1}{\det{\left(\mathrm{Cov}{(p)}\right)^{\frac{1}{2d}}}}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem35.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem35.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined as the vector with the <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th coordinate <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> and all the other coordinates <math id="Thmtheorem35.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
